151	## Scale and scope
152	
153	- **Services.**
154	  - INSPIRE: title, fulltext and citer queries.
155	  - The arXiv API: abstracts, all categories.
156	  - zbMATH Open.
157	  - OpenAlex: seed works, full citer sets of ten seeds, relevance searches top 200.
158	  - Zenodo's public record search: added after OpenAlex surfaced Zenodo-only preprints; same refusal list.
159	- **Volume.** 175 logged queries: topic queries, citer sets, 10 seed-work lookups, 6 title-matching probes, and 9
160	  Zenodo queries that answered HTTP 400 and were re-run. Also 10 INSPIRE record-id lookups and 10 Zenodo record lookups.
161	  That is 316 logged requests in all (`cache/searches/search_log.tsv`), giving 4,099 unique records.
162	- **Reading.** Every record was read by title (`screen/triage.tsv`), with abstracts for candidates. 88 sources were
163	  fetched (67) or reused (21) and read at their anchors. 81 passages are quoted verbatim.
164	- **Positive controls.** All ten seeds (S5, S6, S23, S28, S8, S14, S26, S9, S27, S31) surfaced through queries other
165	  than their own lookups (`screen/positive_controls.tsv`). The OpenAlex citer sets added records that INSPIRE's do not
166	  have, counted there.
167	- **Not searched:**
168	  - Google Scholar, ADS and MathSciNet (account or automation restrictions);
169	  - Semantic Scholar (not needed; the OpenAlex citer sets are complete);
170	  - OpenAlex cursor paging with an API key (basic paging was used instead);
171	  - full texts of papers not indexed by INSPIRE, except those fetched;
172	  - preprint repositories other than Zenodo (Research Square, Preprints.org and the like) beyond what OpenAlex
173	    returned.
174	- **Incidents.** All are recorded in `ledger/searches.md` (Errata), each with its re-run or the coverage left:
175	  - OpenAlex rate limits;
176	  - zbMATH responses cut off, and HTTP 502 beyond the second page;
177	  - Zenodo's page-size limit.
